cc\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize winners list 2010 2011 2012 2013\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... webinar on Tuesday 21 May at 15:00 BST (\\n\\nLast year, almost 290 papers were eligible for this prize and the editor team whittled this down to a shortlist of 16 (listed below); from these, we selected two joint winners and a runner-up. We felt these best ... \",\"title\":\"https://journals.biologists.com/dev/article/151/8/dev202948/347021/Development-s-2023-Outstanding-Paper-Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2024-05-22\\n---\\nOn challenging preconceived notions\\n\\nPrelude\\n\\nJennifer Croft is an author, critic, and translator of Polish, Ukrainian, and Argentine Spanish, and winner of the International Man Booker Prize for her translation of the Nobel Prize-winning Polish novelist Olga Tokarczuk. She lives in Tulsa, Oklahoma, with ... \",\"title\":\"https://thecreativeindependent.com/people/author-and-translator-jennifer-croft-on-challenging-preconceived-notions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her work has been translated into over 20 languages and is being adapted for film and television. She is a recipient of the Rome Prize in Literature as well as fellowships from the Lannan, Jan Michalski and Santa Maddalena Foundations. She teaches in the creative writing program at ... \",\"title\":\"https://manor-mill.com/prose-authors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"p