\n\\\"This is a luminous novel of India and Partition, but one whose spellbinding brio and fierce compassion weaves youth and age, male and female, family and nation into a kaleidoscopic whole.\\\"\\n\\nThe International Booker Prize 2022 Shortlist\\n\\n| Title | Author | Translator | Original Language | Author Residence | Publisher ... \",\"title\":\"https://publishingperspectives.com/2022/05/geetanjali-shree-and-daisy-rockwell-win-the-international-booker-prize/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f6c57ac3e52140232049b6a302cd987374dc8433b4d5d6f779b6a915a7495d69\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"73df581dde7badf009ade417a08f5d510951a067da2f77693bfbf9bb6e9d3913\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"book translated into 26 languages shortlisted Man Asian Literary Prize\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_eb6a19c2adc54dd1b243341e"},{"content":"I notice d44 mentions Mohsin Hamid's novels being \"translated into more than thirty languages\" and \"shortlisted for the Man Booker Prize.\" Let me reconsider — the Man Asian Literary Prize (established 2007) is the award created in the 2000s. Let me look at the Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia page directly and also reconsider the Jan Michalski Prize.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia shortlist winners\", \"Jan Michalski Prize Wikipedia winners 2010s\", \"Mohsin Hamid translated thirty languages Man Asian Literary Prize\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f1ee41236e3f4acc840f18dd","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delive